{"video_id":"jgy-001","points":[{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0001","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"concept_definition","statement":"伤寒与金匮原为一书《伤寒杂病论》，宋后分册；霍乱等非六经篇并入金匮。","evidence_quote":"伤寒杂病论","start_s":32.69,"end_s":37.73,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0002","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"concept_definition","statement":"中医霍乱指呕吐下利，不必等同西医霍乱病名；素问以太阴湿热中满致之。","evidence_quote":"中满祸乱","start_s":61.54,"end_s":108.445,"confidence":0.85},{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0003","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"contraindication","statement":"下利按腹喜按属虚，妄投大承气汤可害人。","evidence_quote":"大承气汤","start_s":718.86,"end_s":732.56,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0004","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"阳明但见热不见寒；能食属阳明，不能食则非阳明。","evidence_quote":"只看到热症","start_s":796.33,"end_s":854.16,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0005","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"diagnostic_rule","statement":"霍乱后恶寒而脉微，为心阳不足，非表寒（表寒脉当浮紧）；当用四逆汤急救。","evidence_quote":"四逆汤","start_s":1248.345,"end_s":1459.985,"confidence":0.9},{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0006","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"formula_indication","statement":"霍乱热多欲饮水（兼小便不利）用五苓散；寒多不欲水用理中丸。","evidence_quote":"五苓散","start_s":1493.115,"end_s":1531.67,"confidence":0.95},{"kp_id":"jgy-001.kp0007","video_id":"jgy-001","type":"pathomechanism","statement":"五苓散证：水停肌表而中焦无水，口渴饮水反吐；散能集表水归膀胱。","evidence_quote":"喝水就吐","start_s":1558.625,"end_s":1563.785,"confidence":0.95}]}